WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:06.696
Unlike hanbok, a dress reveals the natural curves of the body.

2
00:00:07.032 --> 00:00:14.472
So rather than the bold, elaborate look suited to hanbok's voluminous silhouette, a natural yet refined accent makeup works better.

3
00:00:14.808 --> 00:00:20.016
Skin should fully cover imperfections while still having a soft, dewy glow,

4
00:00:20.352 --> 00:00:26.088
and eyeshadow and lips should match the outfit's color and tone for an elegant look that doesn't stand out.

5
00:00:26.424 --> 00:00:36.072
Since dresses expose the shoulders and neckline, applying a fine-shimmer powder to that bare skin too — so it blends seamlessly with the face — is the expert's secret detail.
